logger   logging getlogger   name hopejrarm robot  
    config hopejrarmconfig
    name    hope jr arm init config  hopejrarmconfig  
        super     init   config config   config bus   feetechmotorsbus 
            port config port 
            motors  
                 shoulder pitch   motor 1   sm8512bl   motornormmode range m100 100  
                 shoulder yaw   motor 2   sts3250   motornormmode range m100 100  
                 shoulder roll   motor 3   sts3250   motornormmode range m100 100  
                 elbow flex   motor 4   sts3250   motornormmode range m100 100  
                 wrist roll   motor 5   sts3250   motornormmode range m100 100  
                 wrist yaw   motor 6   sts3250   motornormmode range m100 100  
                 wrist pitch   motor 7   sts3250   motornormmode range m100 100  
              
            calibration calibration cameras   make cameras configs config cameras shoulder pitch    shoulder pitch motors    m m bus motors m     shoulder pitch  

     property motors ft dict str  type f  motor  pos   float motor bus motors 

     property cameras ft dict str  tuple  
        features  dict str  tuple cam cameras 
            cfg config cameras cam getattr cfg   use rgb features cam     cfg height  cfg width  3 getattr cfg   use depth features f  cam  depth      cfg height  cfg width  1 features

     cached property observation features dict str  type   tuple motors ft cameras ft 

     cached property action features dict str  type motors ft

     property connected bool bus connected cam connected cam cameras values   

     check already connected connect calibrate  bool bus connect handshake calibrated calibrate calibrate cam cameras values   
            cam connect configure  
        logger info f connected   

     property calibrated bool bus calibrated calibrate groups list bus motors keys    
             shoulder     shoulder pitch    shoulder yaw    shoulder roll   
             elbow     elbow flex   
             wrist     wrist roll    wrist yaw    wrist pitch calibration   rangefindergui bus  groups  run save calibration  
        print  calibration saved calibration fpath configure self bus torque disabled bus configure motors maximum acceleration 30  acceleration 30 setup motors motor reversed bus motors  
            input f connect controller board motor   motor only press enter bus setup motor motor 
            print f   motor   motor id set bus motors motor  id   

     check connected observation robotobservation 
         
        start   time perf counter  
        obs dict bus sync read  present position motors 
        obs dict shoulder pitch bus read  present position shoulder pitch 
        obs dict    f  motor  pos   val motor  val obs dict items   
        dt ms    time perf counter   - start    1e3
        logger debug f read state   dt ms  1f ms cam key  cam cameras items getattr cam   use rgb start   time perf counter  
                obs dict cam key    cam read latest  
                dt ms    time perf counter   - start    1e3
                logger debug f read  cam key    dt ms  1f ms getattr cam   use depth start   time perf counter  
                obs dict f  cam key  depth     cam read latest depth  
                dt ms    time perf counter   - start    1e3
                logger debug f read  cam key  depth   dt ms  1f ms obs dict

     check connected send action action  robotaction  -  robotaction 
        goal pos    key removesuffix   pos    val key  val action items key endswith   pos config max relative target present pos bus sync read  present position  
            goal present pos    key   g pos  present pos key key  g pos goal pos items   
            goal pos   ensure safe goal position goal present pos config max relative target bus sync write  goal position   goal pos f  motor  pos   val motor  val goal pos items   

     check connected disconnect self bus disconnect config disable torque disconnect cam cameras values   
            cam disconnect  

        logger info f disconnected   
